{
  "id": "city-championships",
  "name": "City Championships",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "City Championships handed out a promo card stamped with the City Championships logo from 2004, when it was a holo EX Dragon Charmander, to the 2015-2016 season; from 2007-2008 each card also came in a Staff copy. After 2004 they were non-holo until 2008-2009, then crosshatch holofoil from Supreme Victors' Gible in 2009-2010 to Furious Fists' Torchic in 2014-2015, and a reverse holo BREAKthrough Parallel City last.\n\nA season's City, State and National Championships cards were often one evolution line: Charmander, Charmeleon and Charizard from EX Dragon in 2004, then Machop's line in 2005, Whismur's in 2006, Squirtle's in 2007, Shinx's in 2007-2008, Dratini's in 2008-2009, Gible's in 2009-2010, Poliwag's in 2010-2011 and Torchic's in 2014-2015.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: EX Dragon (TCG), additional cards",
        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/EX_Dragon_(TCG)#Additional_cards"
      },
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Diamond & Pearl (TCG), additional cards",
        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Diamond_%26_Pearl_(TCG)#Additional_cards"
      },
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Supreme Victors (TCG), additional cards",
